	(text "Every net in docs/net-contract.md sections 1-7 has a pad here, plus extra rail pads at the far ends of\neach rail and a GND pad in every functional area. Rails/GND use D1.5 mm pads, signals D1.0 mm\n(TestPoint_Pad_*: bare SMD copper, no post -- smallest stub, pogo/probe friendly).\nThe full index (TP ref, net, purpose, expected bring-up value) is in bay-station/handoff/io.md and\nfeeds the verification plan. TP1-TP21 keep their numbers; new pads are TP100+."
